{"title": "A range, explained simply", "type": "Explained like you're 5", "hooks": ["Why some charts go nowhere, explained by a stick figure.", "A sideways chart explained like you're five.", "Sideways charts, explained with a floor and a ceiling."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "A sideways chart explained like you're five.", "text": "Ranges, explained like you're 5", "chart": 0, "win": [20, 115], "show": 90}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "A floor and a ceiling", "chart": null, "vo": "Picture a room. The floor is where buyers step in. The ceiling is where sellers step in.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Buyer", "color": "teal"}, {"pose": "stand", "label": "Seller", "color": "amber"}], "cues": [{"say": "where buyers step in", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}, {"say": "The floor", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Cheap! I'll buy"}, {"say": "where sellers step in", "do": "pose", "fig": 1, "pose": "pointl"}, {"say": "The ceiling", "do": "bubble", "fig": 1, "text": "Pricey! I'll sell"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Bounce, bounce, bounce", "chart": null, "vo": "So the price bounces between them. Up to the ceiling, down to the floor. That's a range: highs and lows at about the same prices.", "figures": [{"pose": "stand", "label": "Teacher", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "bounces between them", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "walk"}, {"say": "Up to the ceiling", "do": "bubble", "fig": 0, "text": "Up, down, up, down"}, {"say": "That's a range", "do": "pose", "fig": 0, "pose": "point"}]}, {"kind": "stick", "head": "Now the real chart", "chart": 0, "show": 60, "vo": "Here's Hailo Rideshare. A high at 23.44, then a lower high at 23.31. A low at 21.30, then 21.52.", "figures": [{"pose": "pointl", "label": "Teacher", "color": "white"}], "cues": [{"say": "A high at 23.44", "do": "reveal", "to": 66}, {"say": "A high at 23.44", "do": "mark", "i": 65, "label": "H", "side": "high", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "a lower high at 23.31", "do": "reveal", "to": 